{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glimpse into the daily life of a Fugu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A Fugu's Dive&quot; is a 2D physics-based action game where you use mouse controls to make a Fugu jump and climb higher. Skillfully jump from one body of water to another without falling, and aim for the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the left mouse button and pull back to charge up power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release the button to launch the Fugu in the opposite direction with the stored power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cancel the charge by right-clicking while holding down the left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Fugu is in the air, it cannot be controlled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Esc key to open the pause menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Fugu's Dive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435050/ed0e99ba1d4f5ef0c7bf397bc84b4e4e103ce366.jpg"},{"name":"A Fugu's Daily Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435050/0f2d934d5d3e65e16c12bc8436206a6b1f8fde22.jpg"},{"name":"Now I Can See","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435050/57d882bbb03f8d05456b001edd7d5aba128392c1.jpg"},{"name":"No More Getting Lost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435050/857b1d8da58628f589ff63d6488e10fe64a5a53c.jpg"},{"name":"Know Your Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435050/9f7755bb549be948e00a74e786d20d1b6d72f472.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Medalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3435050/8237ecedf5e60ce2d162ad